    <string name="title_scotland_yard_rules">Scotland Yard – Rules</string>
    <string name="rules_title_objective">Objective</string>
    <string name="rules_description_objective">• Mr. X must evade the detectives and stay hidden.\n• The detectives must track down and catch Mr. X.\n• Detectives win by moving onto Mr. X\'s station.\n• Mr. X wins by surviving until the final round.</string>
    <string name="rules_title_roles">Roles</string>
    <string name="rules_description_roles">Detectives\n• Up to 5 players working as a team.\n• All moves are visible to everyone.\n• Collaborate to corner and catch Mr. X.\n\nMr. X\n• A single hidden player.\n• Position is only revealed at certain rounds.</string>
    <string name="rules_title_movement">Movement</string>
    <string name="rules_description_movement">Players can traverse the gameboard trough:\n• Walking → short distance, widespread\n• E-Scooter → medium distance\n• Car-Sharing → long distance, limited availability\nEach station on the board has at least one transport option assigned, trough which they can be reached.</string>
    <string name="rules_title_gameplay">Gameplay</string>
    <string name="rules_description_gameplay">1. Mr. X\'s turn:\n• Chooses a station to move to.\n• Plays a ticket — the type is visible to detectives, but not the destination.\n• Black tickets hide even the ticket type.\n• In reveal rounds, Mr. X\'s position is shown to all.\n\n2. Detectives\' turns:\n• All detectives move in any order.\n• Spend tickets to travel between stations.\n• Track Mr. X using his ticket history.</string>
    <string name="rules_title_tickets">Tickets</string>
    <string name="rules_description_tickets">Each player has the following tickets:\n• Walking\n• E-Scooter\n• Car-Sharing\n\nSpecial tickets of Mr. X:\n• Black Ticket → transport option stays hidden\n• Double Move → take two turns in one round</string>
    <string name="rules_title_important_rules">Important Rules</string>
    <string name="rules_description_important_rules">• Detectives have no special tickets.\n• A move is only possible, if the correct ticket is available.\n</string>
    <string name="rules_title_game_over">Game Over</string>
    <string name="rules_description_game_over">A game ends, if:\n• A detective catches Mr. X → detectives win.\n• Mr. X is not caught by the final round → Mr. X wins.</string>

